[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0010","text":"────日花！\n马上要正式演出了，有什么需要帮忙的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0020","text":"…………看不出来吗？\n我现在，在集中精神"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0030","text":"啊……\n也是，抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0050","text":"……制作人的工作\n不就是演出前忙来忙去吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0060","text":"真的每天被时间追着跑忙忙乱乱忙忙乱乱…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0070","text":"所以……\n正式演出的时候，请安静一点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0080","text":"……明白了\n我就在这儿看着，安安静静的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0090","text":"────去吧，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0100","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400400_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
